    {
      "name": "02 Cloud Audit",
      "description": "# AIEI Cloud Audit\n\nUtility collection for auditing and synchronizing the AIEI workspace via the Postman API. Ensures the cloud workspace matches the local filesystem and all collections are properly published.\n\n## What it does\n- **List workspace collections** — Enumerate all collections in the cloud workspace\n- **Compare local vs cloud** — Detect drift between filesystem collections and their cloud counterparts\n- **Validate publication state** — Confirm all 18 collections are present and accessible\n\n> **Requires:** `postman_api_key` environment variable with workspace read permissions.",
